<title>FRANCE: MATIF says 117 positions outstanding on May sugar.</title>
<headline>MATIF says 117 positions outstanding on May sugar.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A total of 117 positions were left outstanding on the now expired May sugar contract, French futures exchange MATIF said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The contract expired on April 15.</p>
<p>The lots translate into 5,850 tonnes of sugar on the physical market.</p>
<p>It will be known later in the day or tomorrow on how many outstanding positions sought physical delivery, a MATIF spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
